OL,3,GNEWSACalls for bridge where Coast to
OL,4,ACoast hikers 'scurry across' 70mph road
OL,5,
OL,6,FStretching 190 miles (306km) from St
OL,7,FBees in Cumbria to Robin Hood's Bay in
OL,8,FNorth Yorkshire, the Coast to Coast
OL,9,Fwalk attracts thousands of hikers each
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,FFirst established in 1973 by Alfred
OL,13,FWainwright, and now an official
OL,14,FNational Trail, the route passes
OL,15,Fthrough three national parks, across
OL,16,Fsome of the most remote and rugged
OL,17,Flandscapes in the North of England.
OL,19,FBut beyond the challenges of traversing
OL,20,Fthe fells, meadows and moors - not to
OL,21,Fmention the sore knees - walkers face
OL,22,Fone more hurdle, the A19.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
