OL,3,GNEWSACalls for bridge where Coast to
OL,4,ACoast hikers 'scurry across' 70mph road
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilliam Ainslie, who who has been
OL,7,Fselling organised trips on the Coast to
OL,8,FCoast for 10 years through his
OL,9,FDiscovery Travel Holidays firm,
OL,10,Fdescribes the unofficial crossing point
OL,11,Fon the 70mph (113km/h) dual carriageway
OL,12,Fas among the worst in the UK, and
OL,13,Factively discourages people from
OL,14,Fattempting it.
